      "mitigation": "Surface low-confidence flag; recommend re-acquisition if clinically actionable."
    },
    {
      "id": "scanner_ood",
      "title": "Vendor not in training distribution",
      "summary": "GroupNorm helps, but extreme cross-vendor shifts (Hitachi, Canon) degrade AUC ≈ 0.08.",
